        "original_id": "4121289b-14c2-50c0-8cff-e3586df61f21",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Gorton, Harold Holt, Robert Menzies, John McEwen, William McMahon\n- Roles: Prime Minister of Australia, minister\n- Places: Stanmore, New South Wales\n- Organizations: University of Melbourne\n\nFacts:\n- John Gorton was born on 9 September 1911 and died on 19 May 2002.\n- Harold Holt was born in Stanmore, New South Wales.\n- Harold Holt won a scholarship to study law at the University of Melbourne.\n- John Gorton was the 19th Prime Minister of Australia.\n- John Gorton served as a long-serving minister in the governments of Robert Menzies, Harold Holt, John McEwen, and William McMahon.",
